  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f32df80fcd9ecd04789b52c360eb0452, type: 3}
  m_Name: Shopkeeper-CaughtStealing
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC_Dialogue
  npcName: Shopkeeper
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 2271418499114721684, guid: 30c0f5dafdf80d74b83bc6ef315e84ab, type: 3}
  dilaogueLines:
  - Aha! What have we here?
  - A lowly thief trying to steal my merchandise?
  - I ought to hand you over to the authorities!
  - "Unless\u2026"
  - ...
  - "Say\u2026 I have a proposition for you."
  - "I see you\u2019ve got quite the nimble hands."
  - "I\u2019d be willing to overlook this\u2026 incident IF you do something for
    me."
  - "You see, there\u2019s this item that I have been trying to get my hands on for
    a while."
  - "And there\u2019s no way that I can get it on my own."
  - "But you\u2026"
  - "You might be able to\u2026"
  - So what do you say? Wanna work for me?
  - "Well jokes on you, I wasn\u2019t really asking."
  - You are going to do it.
  - "Great! I knew you\u2019d make the right choice!"
  - Besides, you seem to have a knack for stealing.
  - You seem to enjoy it as well.
  - Anyhow, let me tell you what I want you to steal.
  - "I want you to steal\u2026"
  - "The King\u2019s Crown."
  - "Don\u2019t worry, it\u2019s scarier than it sounds."
  - "Plus it\u2019s actually pretty simple, you just need to find a way into the
    castle first."
  - "So get that for me and we\u2019re square."
  - Otherwise, you can kiss your freedom goodbye.
  - "Alright, now get to it! That crown won\u2019t steal itself!"
  autoProgressLines: 0101010101010101010101010101010101010101010101010101
